lemma paying : High.clusterBound (alt k) (Eξ) (alt k)+Eξ ≤ Gξ:= accessG _ _ _ _ (by unfold alt extraN horizon Shop.tall at *; omega) (by have hC:= (bless R Q A F h hk)|>.2.1; change 4*(_+4)≤ B at hC; omega)
